I am in the office now.
Priya and I are sitting at my desk.
Priya is a designer in our team.
We are looking at the new user interface on the computer.
"Maya, these new designs are ready," Priya says.
"They look very good, Priya," I tell her.
"Shall we check the colours once?" she asks.
"Yes, definitely."
"This blue colour looks nice here," I reply.
We complete our work quickly.
A few weeks ago, this big project felt very difficult.
We were all very stressed then.
I prepare the report quickly.
It is now just our everyday work.
"Are you sending this to Vikram now?" I ask.
"Yes, I am sending the files to him now," Priya says.
"Great, then my code is also ready," I tell her.
We both look at each other and smile.
Today's work gets done ahead of time.
Priya looks at me and smiles with satisfaction.
